<div class="exclude-units" id="tab-bis-lists-phase-1-bis" role="tabpanel" style="" tabindex="0">This list represents the best overall gear available in Mists of Pandaria Classic Phase 1. If you don't have the entire set you might not reach 8089 Haste. If you can't reach 8089 Haste, do not prioritize reforging to Haste. If you don't have the full set you might not reach the breakpoint and should reforge more towards Critical Strike instead. Simming yourself is advised.<br/>
