<br/>The 4 piece bonus changes the haste breakpoints for our dots, giving us a goal of 8089 haste, which is very hard to reach.<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="trinkets">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/creatureportrait_twilightshammer_dragonegg_01.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Balance Druid Trinkets in Phase 1</span></h2>For DPS trinkets in Phase 1, there are only two that are from raiding and those are the ones we want the most. As getting two raid trinkets can be hard, you will likely have to run Celestial Dungeon Trinkets or Relic of Yu'lon.<ul class="exclude-units">
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87175/essence-of-terror">
<img alt="Essence of Terror" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_misc_pvp_trinket.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Essence of Terror</span></a> is our strongest trinket in Phase 1. It's a strong trinket, although less consistent than the other two with its much longer cooldown.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=87065/light-of-the-cosmos">
<img alt="Light of the Cosmos" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_offhand_ulduarraid_d_03.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Light of the Cosmos</span></a> is our second strongest trinket in Phase 1. It is not that far behind Essence of Terror, and a general rule of thumb is that if you must choose between the two, choose the highest item level.</div></li>
<li>
<div data-markup-content-target="1">
<a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=79331/relic-of-yulon">
<img alt="Relic of Yu'lon" loading="lazy" src="https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/tiny/inv_inscription_trinket_dragon.gif" style="vertical-align: middle;"/> <span class="tinyicontxt">Relic of Yu'lon</span></a> is our third option for trinkets in Phase 1. Despite being much lower item level, it is still our third best option, only losing to the heroic version of the two other trinkets. Meaning that if you don't have both Essence of Terror and Light of the Cosmos on heroic, this one is better to use.</div></li></ul>
<h2 class="heading-size-2 heading-bar" id="reputation">
<span data-markup-content-target="1">
<span class="iconmedium" data-color="c11" data-env="mists" data-game="wow" data-kind="round" data-tree="mists">
<ins class="lazy-load-background" style='background-image: url("https://wow.zamimg.com/images/wow/icons/medium/achievement_faction_shadopan_assault.jpg");'></ins>
<del></del></span> Best Reputation Items for Balance Druids</span></h2>Reputation gear can be very strong, but it can also be difficult to choose which factions to prioritize first. As a Balance Druid, we recommend you prioritize <a data-entity="faction" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/faction=1270/shado-pan">
<span class="tinyicontxt">Shado-Pan</span></a> to get your hands on <a class="q4 icontiny" data-entity="item" data-entity-has-icon="true" data-game="wow" data-type="item" href="https://www.wowhead.com/mop-classic/item=89078/sagewhispers-wrap">
